  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.82 “Relevant experience” means experience that is applicable to the duties, knowledge, or skills required by a specific job or position.\n\nSource. #14132-A, eff 11-27-24; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.71), eff 12-1-25",
